WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:06,800
build

2
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:12,220
automatic flush

3
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:13,220
automatic cleaning

4
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:14,860
It even has heating

5
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:16,940
No wonder it can be installed without sewers

6
00:00:19,590 --> 00:00:20,510
Classmate Jiang Lei

7
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,540
Why don't you go out first?

8
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,580
I'm going to the toilet and I won't go out

9
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,700
The monsters will invade in about ten minutes.

10
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,100
What if I'm locked out?

11
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:30,780
It doesn't work if I can solve the problem in five minutes at most.

12
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,100
Many people are watching outside

13
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,860
What if I go out and get stared at?

14
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:35,900
At worst, I just turn my head and don’t look.

15
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,780
Anyway, we will live together from now on

16
00:00:37,780 --> 00:00:40,100
If you can't stand even this little problem

17
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:42,700
How can we survive in this dangerous world?

18
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,380
Although a little ashamed

19
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:49,220
But we have to live together from now on anyway
